    {
      "id": "the-first-part-of-henry-the-sixth/chap12/p@3267",
      "type": "cast",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "KING HENRY the Sixth\nDUKE OF GLOUCESTER, uncle to the King, and Protector\nDUKE OF BEDFORD, uncle to the King, and Regent of France\nDUKE OF EXETER, (Thomas Beaufort), great-uncle to the King\nBISHOP OF WINCHESTER (Henry Beaufort), great-uncle to the King, afterwards Cardinal\nDUKE OF SOMERSET (John Beaufort)\nRICHARD PLANTAGENET, son of Richard, late Earl of Cambridge, afterwards Duke of York\nEARL OF WARWICK\nEARL OF SALISBURY\nEARL OF SUFFOLK\nLORD TALBOT, afterwards Earl of Shrewsbury\nJOHN TALBOT, his son\nEdmund MORTIMER, Earl of March\nSIR JOHN FASTOLF\nSIR WILLIAM LUCY\nSIR WILLIAM GLANSDALE\nSIR THOMAS GARGRAVE\nMAYOR of London\nWOODVILLE, Lieutenant of the Tower\nVERNON, of the White-Rose or York faction\nBASSET, of the Red-Rose or Lancaster faction\nA LAWYER\nMortimer’s JAILERS",
